<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="It Is What It Is"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Blood Orange"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Samantha Urbani"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Cupid Deluxe"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="27926564"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="GBCEL1300471"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="190055247"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="DEVILISALIE"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:00.777"><div begin="00:39.505" end="04:00.777"><p begin="00:39.505" end="00:41.040" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L0"><span begin="00:39.505" end="00:39.831">I've</span> <span begin="00:39.831" end="00:40.123">kept</span> <span begin="00:40.123" end="00:40.329">it</span> <span begin="00:40.411" end="00:40.745">o</span><span begin="00:40.745" end="00:41.040">pen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">心门一直敞着</span></p><p begin="00:43.961" end="00:46.574" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:43.961" end="00:44.234">And</span> <span begin="00:44.234" end="00:44.468">wan</span><span begin="00:44.468" end="00:44.738">ted</span> <span begin="00:44.738" end="00:45.042">no</span><span begin="00:45.042" end="00:45.170">bo</span><span begin="00:45.170" end="00:45.368">dy</span> <span begin="00:45.368" end="00:45.587">to</span> <span begin="00:45.587" end="00:45.842">be</span> <span begin="00:45.842" end="00:46.109">my</span> <span begin="00:46.109" end="00:46.574">friend</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只盼别有人闯进来当朋友</span></p><p begin="00:49.014" end="00:51.754" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:49.014" end="00:49.287">I've</span> <span begin="00:49.287" end="00:49.552">was</span><span begin="00:49.552" end="00:49.766">ted</span> <span begin="00:49.766" end="00:50.049">mo</span><span begin="00:50.049" end="00:50.269">ments</span> <span begin="00:50.269" end="00:50.415">in</span> <span begin="00:50.415" end="00:50.595">the</span> <span begin="00:50.595" end="00:50.874">Bowe</span><span begin="00:50.874" end="00:51.127">ry</span> <span begin="00:51.127" end="00:51.754">light</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我在鲍厄里的街灯下虚掷了年华</span></p><p begin="00:54.697" end="00:56.783" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:54.697" end="00:54.989">And</span> <span begin="00:54.989" end="00:55.282">lost</span> <span begin="00:55.282" end="00:55.975">it</span> <span begin="00:55.975" end="00:56.783">all</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">失去所有</span></p><p begin="00:59.739" end="01:01.391" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:59.739" end="01:00.022">So,</span> <span begin="01:00.022" end="01:00.319">are</span> <span begin="01:00.319" end="01:00.645">you</span> <span begin="01:00.645" end="01:00.919">smo</span><span begin="01:00.919" end="01:01.391">king?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以，你在抽烟吗？</span></p><p begin="01:03.552" end="01:06.769" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="01:03.552" end="01:03.811">Don't</span> <span begin="01:03.811" end="01:04.098">tell</span> <span begin="01:04.098" end="01:04.422">me,</span> <span begin="01:04.422" end="01:04.742">ba</span><span begin="01:04.742" end="01:05.065">by,</span> <span begin="01:05.065" end="01:05.370">you</span> <span begin="01:05.370" end="01:05.676">can't</span> <span begin="01:05.676" end="01:05.963">work</span> <span begin="01:05.963" end="01:06.303">this</span> <span begin="01:06.303" end="01:06.769">out</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">别跟我说，宝贝，你搞不定这事</span></p><p begin="01:09.267" end="01:12.011" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="01:09.267" end="01:09.545">I've</span> <span begin="01:09.545" end="01:09.817">was</span><span begin="01:09.817" end="01:10.020">ted</span> <span begin="01:10.020" end="01:10.351">mo</span><span begin="01:10.351" end="01:10.523">ments</span> <span begin="01:10.523" end="01:10.679">in</span> <span begin="01:10.679" end="01:10.863">the</span> <span begin="01:10.863" end="01:11.107">So</span><span begin="01:11.107" end="01:11.370">ho</span> <span begin="01:11.370" end="01:12.011">nights</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我在苏荷的夜色里耗尽了时刻</span></p><p begin="01:14.885" end="01:17.102" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="01:14.885" end="01:15.161">And</span> <span begin="01:15.161" end="01:15.530">lost</span> <span begin="01:15.530" end="01:16.201">it</span> <span begin="01:16.201" end="01:17.102">all</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">失去所有</span></p><p begin="01:21.485" end="01:25.800" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="01:21.485" end="01:21.789">Time</span> <span begin="01:21.789" end="01:22.105">will</span> <span begin="01:22.105" end="01:22.439">tell</span> <span begin="01:22.439" end="01:22.783">if</span> <span begin="01:22.783" end="01:23.071">you</span> <span begin="01:23.071" end="01:23.379">can</span> <span begin="01:23.379" end="01:23.684">fi</span><span begin="01:23.684" end="01:23.982">gure</span> <span begin="01:23.982" end="01:24.263">this</span> <span begin="01:24.263" end="01:24.552">and</span> <span begin="01:24.552" end="01:24.896">work</span> <span begin="01:24.896" end="01:25.251">it</span> <span begin="01:25.251" end="01:25.800">out</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">时间会告诉你，能不能想明白、搞定这事</span></p><p begin="01:26.512" end="01:30.989" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="01:26.512" end="01:26.810">No</span> <span begin="01:26.810" end="01:27.170">one's</span> <span begin="01:27.170" end="01:27.477">wai</span><span begin="01:27.477" end="01:27.786">ting</span> <span begin="01:27.786" end="01:28.074">for</span> <span begin="01:28.074" end="01:28.428">you</span> <span begin="01:28.428" end="01:28.706">a</span><span begin="01:28.706" end="01:29.003">ny</span><span begin="01:29.003" end="01:29.328">way</span> <span begin="01:29.328" end="01:29.631">so</span> <span begin="01:29.631" end="01:30.003">don't</span> <span begin="01:30.003" end="01:30.315">be</span> <span begin="01:30.315" end="01:30.621">stressed</span> <span begin="01:30.621" end="01:30.989">now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">反正没人等你，别给自己加压</span></p><p begin="01:31.607" end="01:36.094" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:31.607" end="01:31.867">E</span><span begin="01:31.867" end="01:32.240">ven</span> <span begin="01:32.240" end="01:32.534">if</span> <span begin="01:32.534" end="01:32.864">it's</span> <span begin="01:32.864" end="01:33.188">some</span><span begin="01:33.188" end="01:33.491">thing</span> <span begin="01:33.491" end="01:33.783">that</span> <span begin="01:33.783" end="01:34.107">you've</span> <span begin="01:34.107" end="01:34.399">had</span> <span begin="01:34.399" end="01:34.735">your</span> <span begin="01:34.735" end="01:35.415">eye</span> <span begin="01:35.415" end="01:36.094">on</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">就算那是你眼馋已久的</span></p><p begin="01:36.959" end="01:39.581" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:36.959" end="01:37.243">It</span> <span begin="01:37.243" end="01:37.583">is</span> <span begin="01:37.583" end="01:37.913">what</span> <span begin="01:37.913" end="01:38.217">it</span> <span begin="01:38.217" end="01:39.581">is</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">事已至此</span></p><p begin="01:40.153" end="01:42.047" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:40.153" end="01:40.412">On</span> <span begin="01:40.412" end="01:40.738">your</span> <span begin="01:40.738" end="01:41.051">own</span> <span begin="01:41.051" end="01:41.379">wor</span><span begin="01:41.379" end="01:42.047">ries</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">陷在各自的烦忧里</span></p><p begin="01:44.587" end="01:47.527" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:44.587" end="01:44.870">I'm</span> <span begin="01:44.870" end="01:45.152">no</span><span begin="01:45.152" end="01:45.363">thing</span> <span begin="01:45.363" end="01:45.660">e</span><span begin="01:45.660" end="01:45.832">ven</span> <span begin="01:45.832" end="01:45.995">when</span> <span begin="01:45.995" end="01:46.220">I'm</span> <span begin="01:46.220" end="01:46.475">with</span> <span begin="01:46.475" end="01:46.757">my</span> <span begin="01:46.757" end="01:47.527">friends</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">和朋友在一块儿，我也觉得自己一无所有</span></p><p begin="01:49.514" end="01:52.511" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:49.514" end="01:49.604">But</span> <span begin="01:49.604" end="01:49.941">you</span> <span begin="01:49.941" end="01:50.217">make</span> <span begin="01:50.217" end="01:50.501">me</span> <span begin="01:50.501" end="01:50.835">think</span> <span begin="01:50.835" end="01:51.152">that</span> <span begin="01:51.152" end="01:51.451">I'm</span> <span begin="01:51.451" end="01:51.733">a</span><span begin="01:51.733" end="01:52.511">live</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可你让我觉得自己还活着</span></p><p begin="01:55.308" end="01:57.408" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:55.308" end="01:55.618">When</span> <span begin="01:55.618" end="01:55.915">I'm</span> <span begin="01:55.915" end="01:56.558">a</span><span begin="01:56.558" end="01:57.408">lone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当我独自一人时</span></p><p begin="02:01.926" end="02:06.124" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="02:01.926" end="02:02.203">Time</span> <span begin="02:02.203" end="02:02.552">will</span> <span begin="02:02.552" end="02:02.830">tell</span> <span begin="02:02.830" end="02:03.170">if</span> <span begin="02:03.170" end="02:03.508">you</span> <span begin="02:03.508" end="02:03.824">can</span> <span begin="02:03.824" end="02:04.147">fi</span><span begin="02:04.147" end="02:04.446">gure</span> <span begin="02:04.446" end="02:04.754">this</span> <span begin="02:04.754" end="02:05.121">and</span> <span begin="02:05.121" end="02:05.418">work</span> <span begin="02:05.418" end="02:05.721">it</span> <span begin="02:05.721" end="02:06.124">out</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="02:05.409" end="02:06.957"><span begin="02:05.409" end="02:05.733">(You'll</span> <span begin="02:05.733" end="02:06.061">work</span> <span begin="02:06.061" end="02:06.224">it</span> <span begin="02:06.224" end="02:06.957">out)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你能搞定的</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">时间会告诉你，能不能想明白、搞定这事</span></p><p begin="02:06.925" end="02:11.481" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="02:06.925" end="02:07.179">No</span> <span begin="02:07.179" end="02:07.543">one's</span> <span begin="02:07.543" end="02:07.818">wai</span><span begin="02:07.818" end="02:08.200">ting</span> <span begin="02:08.200" end="02:08.552">for</span> <span begin="02:08.552" end="02:08.901">you</span> <span begin="02:08.901" end="02:09.183">a</span><span begin="02:09.183" end="02:09.488">ny</span><span begin="02:09.488" end="02:09.782">way</span> <span begin="02:09.782" end="02:10.066">so</span> <span begin="02:10.066" end="02:10.414">don't</span> <span begin="02:10.414" end="02:10.735">be</span> <span begin="02:10.735" end="02:11.033">stressed</span> <span begin="02:11.033" end="02:11.481">now</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="02:09.787" end="02:11.444"><span begin="02:09.787" end="02:10.090">(So</span> <span begin="02:10.090" end="02:10.414">don't</span> <span begin="02:10.414" end="02:10.708">be</span> <span begin="02:10.708" end="02:11.025">stressed</span> <span begin="02:11.025" end="02:11.444">now)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">别给自己加压</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">反正没人等你，别给自己加压</span></p><p begin="02:11.987" end="02:16.525" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="02:11.987" end="02:12.365">E</span><span begin="02:12.365" end="02:12.662">ven</span> <span begin="02:12.662" end="02:12.960">if</span> <span begin="02:12.960" end="02:13.305">it's</span> <span begin="02:13.305" end="02:13.607">some</span><span begin="02:13.607" end="02:13.969">thing</span> <span begin="02:13.969" end="02:14.272">that</span> <span begin="02:14.272" end="02:14.559">you've</span> <span begin="02:14.559" end="02:14.837">had</span> <span begin="02:14.837" end="02:15.145">your</span> <span begin="02:15.145" end="02:15.867">eye</span> <span begin="02:15.867" end="02:16.525">on</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="02:15.142" end="02:16.605"><span begin="02:15.142" end="02:15.815">(Eye</span> <span begin="02:15.815" end="02:16.605">on)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你眼馋已久的</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">就算那是你眼馋已久的</span></p><p begin="02:17.413" end="02:19.992" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="02:17.413" end="02:17.681">It</span> <span begin="02:17.681" end="02:17.984">is</span> <span begin="02:17.984" end="02:18.350">what</span> <span begin="02:18.350" end="02:18.667">it</span> <span begin="02:18.667" end="02:19.992">is</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">事已至此</span></p><p begin="02:20.393" end="02:22.576" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="02:20.393" end="02:20.579">And</span> <span begin="02:20.579" end="02:20.721">it</span> <span begin="02:20.721" end="02:21.175">keeps</span> <span begin="02:21.175" end="02:21.554">on</span> <span begin="02:21.554" end="02:21.726">run</span><span begin="02:21.726" end="02:21.876">ning</span> <span begin="02:21.876" end="02:22.576">back</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">它总是一次次绕回来</span></p><p begin="02:22.158" end="02:26.367" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="02:22.158" end="02:22.441">Time</span> <span begin="02:22.441" end="02:22.817">will</span> <span begin="02:22