<span begin="03:35.386" end="03:36.084">lone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">Roxy的喧闹让我心神不宁，我独自待在家里</span></p><p begin="03:42.303" end="03:45.906" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="03:42.303" end="03:42.622">Ta</span><span begin="03:42.622" end="03:42.970">king</span> <span begin="03:42.970" end="03:43.257">it</span> <span begin="03:43.257" end="03:43.592">for</span> <span begin="03:43.592" end="03:43.879">gran</span><span begin="03:43.879" end="03:44.173">ted</span> <span begin="03:44.173" end="03:44.474">that</span> <span begin="03:44.474" end="03:44.803">you're</span> <span begin="03:44.803" end="03:45.181">here</span> <span begin="03:45.181" end="03:45.483">with</span> <span begin="03:45.483" end="03:45.906">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我理所当然以为你会陪在我身边</span></p><p begin="03:48.343" end="03:51.009" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="03:48.343" end="03:48.683">Just</span> <span begin="03:48.683" end="03:48.981">tell</span> <span begin="03:48.981" end="03:49.292">me</span> <span begin="03:49.292" end="03:49.599">the</span> <span begin="03:49.599" end="03:51.009">truth</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">就告诉我实话吧</span></p><p begin="03:52.466" end="03:56.009" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="03:52.466" end="03:52.769">Am</span> <span begin="03:52.769" end="03:53.108">I</span> <span begin="03:53.108" end="03:53.410">just</span> <span begin="03:53.410" end="03:53.734">a</span> <span begin="03:53.734" end="03:54.017">lone</span><span begin="03:54.017" end="03:54.330">ly</span> <span begin="03:54.330" end="03:54.650">fa</span><span begin="03:54.650" end="03:54.979">bled</span> <span begin="03:54.979" end="03:55.283">o</span><span begin="03:55.283" end="03:55.597">bses</span><span begin="03:55.597" end="03:56.009">sive?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">难道我只是个孤独的、传说里的痴迷者？</span></p><p begin="03:58.428" end="04:00.777" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><spa